."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"홈에 표시할 행(영상, 배우, 스튜디오, 갤러리, 채널)과 순서를 선택하세요."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Kies welke rijen Home toont – scènes, performers, studio's, galerijen, kanalen – en hun volgorde."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Choose which rows Home shows — scenes, performers, studios, galleries, Channels — and their order."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wybierz, które wiersze pokazuje ekran Start — sceny, aktorzy, studia, galerie, kanały — i w jakiej kolejności."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Elige qué filas muestra Inicio (escenas, intérpretes, estudios, galerías, canales) y su orden."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ホームに表示する行（シーン、出演者、スタジオ、ギャラリー、チャンネル）とその順序を選択します。"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Choisissez les rangées affichées sur l'accueil — scènes, performeurs, studios, galeries, chaînes — et leur ordre."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Vælg, hvilke rækker Hjem viser – scener, kunstnere, studier, gallerier, kanaler – og deres rækkefølge."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wähle, welche Zeilen Start zeigt – Szenen, Darsteller, Studios, Galerien, Kanäle – und ihre Reihenfolge."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Velg hvilke rader Hjem viser – scener, utøvere, studioer, gallerier, kanaler – og rekkefølgen deres."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Välj vilka rader Hem visar – scener, stjärnor, studior, gallerier, kanaler – och i vilken ordning."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"选择主页显示哪些行（短片、演员、工作室、图库、频道）及其顺序。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"選擇首頁要顯示哪些列（短片、演員、工作室、圖庫、頻道）及其順序。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ana Sayfa'nın hangi satırları göstereceğini — sahneler, oyuncular, stüdyolar, galeriler, Kanallar — ve sıralarını seç."}}}},"hint_choose_whose_profile_picture_this":{"localizations":{"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Bu resmin kimin profil resmi olacağını seç."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"选择将此图片用作谁的头像。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"選擇要將此圖片設為誰的個人圖片。"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wybierz, czyim zdjęciem profilowym stanie się ten obraz."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Välj vems profilbild den här bilden blir."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Velg hvem som får dette bildet som profilbilde."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"この画像を誰のプロフィール写真にするか選択してください。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"이 이미지를 누구의 프로필 사진으로 사용할지 선택하세요."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Choose whose profile picture this image becomes."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Выберите, чьим изображением профиля станет это изображение."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Kies van wie deze afbeelding de profielfoto wordt."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Scegli di chi diventa l'immagine del profilo."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wähle, wessen Profilbild dieses Bild wird."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Elige de quién será esta imagen como foto de perfil."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Vælg, hvis profilbillede dette billede skal være."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Escolha de quem esta imagem será a foto de perfil."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Choisissez de qui cette image devient la photo de profil."}}}},"hint_clear_cached_artwork_for_active":{"localizations":{"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wyczyść zapisane grafiki aktywnego serwera. Obrazy zostaną ponownie pobrane, gdy znów będą wyświetlane."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review",