eeds_review","value":"Abre esta imagem; Voltar retorna ao RateMe"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"이 이미지를 엽니다. 뒤로를 누르면 RateMe로 돌아갑니다"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Apre questa immagine; Indietro torna a RateMe"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Opent deze afbeelding; Terug keert terug naar RateMe"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Otwiera ten obraz; Wstecz wraca do RateMe"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Öppnar bilden; Tillbaka går tillbaka till RateMe"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Opens this image; Back returns to RateMe"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ouvre cette image ; Retour ramène à RateMe"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Öffnet dieses Bild; Zurück kehrt zu RateMe zurück"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Åbner dette billede; Tilbage vender tilbage til RateMe"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Открывает это изображение; «Назад» возвращает в RateMe"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Abre esta imagen; Atrás vuelve a RateMe"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Åpner dette bildet; Tilbake går tilbake til RateMe"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"打开此图片；返回可回到 RateMe"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"打開此圖片；返回會回到 RateMe"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Bu resmi açar; Geri, RateMe'ye döner"}}}},"hint_opens_this_scene_back_returns":{"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"打开此短片；返回可回到 RateMe"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Bu sahneyi açar; Geri, RateMe'ye döner"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Öppnar scenen; Tillbaka går tillbaka till RateMe"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"打開此短片；返回會回到 RateMe"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Öffnet diese Szene; Zurück kehrt zu RateMe zurück"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Abre esta cena; Voltar retorna ao RateMe"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Åpner denne scenen; Tilbake går tilbake til RateMe"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Opens this scene; Back returns to RateMe"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Abre esta escena; Atrás vuelve a RateMe"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Otwiera tę scenę; Wstecz wraca do RateMe"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"이 영상을 엽니다. 뒤로를 누르면 RateMe로 돌아갑니다"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Apre questa scena; Indietro torna a RateMe"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Opent deze scène; Terug keert terug naar RateMe"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Открывает эту сцену; «Назад» возвращает в RateMe"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ouvre cette scène ; Retour ramène à RateMe"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Åbner denne scene; Tilbage vender tilbage til RateMe"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"このシーンを開きます。戻るでRateMeに戻ります"}}}},"hint_optional_used_instead_of_address":{"localizations":{"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Facultatif. Utilisée à la place de l'adresse ci-dessus dès qu'elle répond, par exemple sur votre réseau domestique. Bascule automatiquement sinon."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Valgfri. Bruges i stedet for adressen ovenfor, når den svarer, f.eks. på dit hjemmenetværk. Skifter automatisk tilbage."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"任意。応答がある場合（自宅のネットワークなど）は、上のアドレスの代わりに使用されます。自動的に切り替わります。"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Opcjonalnie. Używany zamiast powyższego adresu, gdy tylko odpowiada, np. w sieci domowej. W razie potrzeby automatycznie wraca do zwykłego adresu."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Optioneel. Wordt gebruikt in plaats van het adres hierboven zodra het antwoordt, bijvoorbeeld op je thuisnetwerk. Valt automatisch terug."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Valgfritt. Brukes i stedet for adressen ovenfor når den svarer, for eksempel på hjemmenettverket. Faller automatisk tilbake."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Необязательно. Используется вместо адреса выше, когда отвечает, например в домашней сети. При недоступности — автоматический возврат."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Opcional. Usado no lugar do endereço acima sempre que responder, por exemplo na sua rede doméstica. Volta automaticamente ao outro."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"선택 사항. 홈 네트워크 등에서 응답할 때마다 위의 주소 대신 사용됩니다. 응답하지 않으면 자동으로 되돌아갑니다."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Facoltativo. Usato al posto dell'indirizzo qui sopra ogni volta che risponde, ad esempio sulla rete di casa. Altrimenti torna automaticamente all'altro."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Optional. Used instead of the address above whenever it answers, for example on your home network. Falls back automatically."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Opcional. Se usa en lugar de la dirección de arriba siempre que responda, por ejemplo en tu red doméstica. Si no, se vuelve a la otra automáticamente."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Optional. Wird statt der Adresse oben verwendet, sobald sie antwortet, etwa in deinem Heimnetz. Wechselt automatisch zurück."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"可选。只要该地址有响应（例如在家庭网络中），就会代替上方地址使用。会自动回退。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"İsteğe bağlı. Yanıt verdiği sürece, örneğin ev ağında, yukarıdaki adres yerine kullanılır. Otomatik olarak geri döner."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"選填。只要能連上，就會取代上方的位址，例如在你的家用網路中。連不上時會自動改用原位址。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Valfritt. Används i stället för adressen ovan när den svarar, till exempel på ditt hemnätverk. Faller tillbaka automatiskt."}}}},"hint_original_could_not_be_played":{"localizations":{"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"無法播放原始檔 — 改用伺服器轉檔"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Orijinal oynatılamadı — sunucu dönüştürmesi kullanılıyor"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"无法播放原始文件 — 正在使用服务器转码"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Не удалось воспроизвести оригинал — используется перекодировка сервера"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"No se pudo reproducir el original; se usa la transcodificación del servidor"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Impossibile riprodurre l'originale: uso della transcodifica del server"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Originalen kunne ikke spilles av – bruker serverens transkoding"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Original konnte nicht abgespielt werden – Server-Transcode wird verwendet"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"オリジナルを再生できませんでした — サーバーのトランスコードを使用します"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Originalen kunne ikke afspilles – bruger serverens omkodning"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Nie można odtworzyć oryginału — używane jest transkodowanie serwera"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"L'original n'a pas pu être lu — utilisation du transcodage du serveur"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Origineel kon niet worden afgespeeld – de servertranscode wordt gebruikt"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Originalet kunde inte spelas – använder serverns omkodning"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Original could not be played — using the server transcode"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"원본을 재생할 수 없습니다 — 서버 트랜스코드를 사용합니다"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Não foi possível reproduzir o original — usando a transcodificação do servidor"}}}},"hint_other_names_for_this_tag":{"localizations":{"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Inne nazwy tego tagu. Przesuń w lewo, aby usunąć."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Outros nomes para esta etiqueta. Deslize para a esquerda para remover um."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"이 태그의 다른 이름입니다. 제거하려면 왼쪽으로 쓸어넘기세요."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Andere Namen für diesen Tag. Nach links wischen, um einen zu entfernen."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"このタグの別名です。左にスワイプして削除します。"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Andere namen voor dit label. Veeg naar links om er een te verwijderen."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Другие названия этого тега. Смахните влево, чтобы удалить."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Andre navn på denne taggen. Sveip til venstre for å fjerne ett."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Other names for this tag. Swipe left to remove one."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Autres noms de cette étiquette. Balayez vers la gauche pour en retirer un."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Altri nomi per questo tag. Scorri a sinistra per rimuoverne uno."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Andre navne for dette tag. Stryg til venstre for at fjerne et."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Otros nombres de esta etiqueta. Desliza a la izquierda para quitar uno."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Bu etiketin diğer adları. Birini kaldırmak için sola kaydır."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"此標籤的其他名稱。向左滑動即可移除。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Andra namn på taggen. Svep åt vänster för att ta bort ett."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"此标签的其他名称。向左轻扫可移除。"}}}},"hint_payment_is_charged_to_your":{"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"费用将从你的 Apple 账户扣除。除非在当前周期结束前至少 24 小时取消，否则订阅将自动续订。可随时在 App Store 设置中管理或取消。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"款項將從你的 Apple ID 扣款。除非在期間結束前至少 24 小時取消，否則訂閱會自動續訂。你可隨時在 App Store 設定中管理或取消。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ödeme Apple Kimliğin'den alınır. Abonelikler, dönem bitmeden en az 24 saat önce iptal edilmezse otomatik olarak yenilenir. App Store ayarlarından istediğin zaman yönet veya iptal et."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"결제 금액은 Apple ID로 청구됩니다. 구독 기간이 끝나기 최소 24시간 전에 취소하지 않으면 구독이 자동으로 갱신됩니다. 언제든지 App Store 설정에서 관리하거나 취소할 수 있습니다."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"お支払いはApple IDに請求されます。サブスクリプションは期間終了の24時間以上前に解約しない限り自動更新されます。App Storeの設定でいつでも管理または解約できます。"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Betalingen trækkes på dit Apple-id. Abonnementer fornyes automatisk, medmindre de opsiges mindst 24 timer før periodens udløb. Administrer eller opsig når som helst i dine App Store-indstillinger."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Płatność zostanie pobrana z Twojego Apple ID. Subskrypcje odnawiają się automatycznie, chyba że zostaną anulowane co najmniej 24 godziny przed końcem okresu. Zarządzaj nimi lub anuluj w dowolnym momencie w ustawieniach App Store."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"El pago se carga en tu Apple ID. Las suscripciones se renuevan automáticamente salvo que se cancelen al menos 24 horas antes de que termine el periodo. Gestiónalas o cancélalas cuando quieras en los ajustes del App Store."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Le paiement est débité sur votre identifiant Apple. Les abonnements se renouvellent automatiquement sauf résiliation au moins 24 heures avant la fin de la période. Gérez-les ou résiliez-les à tout moment dans les réglages de l'App Store."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"De betaling wordt in rekening gebracht via je Apple ID. Abonnementen worden automatisch verlengd, tenzij je ze minstens 24 uur voor het einde van de periode opzegt. Beheer of zeg op wanneer je wilt in je App Store-instellingen."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Betalningen debiteras ditt Apple-ID. Prenumerationer förnyas automatiskt om de inte avslutas minst 24 timmar innan perioden slutar. Hantera eller avsluta när som helst i dina App Store-inställningar."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Оплата списывается с вашего Apple ID. Подписка продлевается автоматически, если не отменить ее как минимум за 24 часа до конца периода. Управлять подпиской или отменить ее можно в любое время в настройках App Store."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Betalingen belastes Apple-ID-en din. Abonnementer fornyes automatisk med mindre de avsluttes minst 24 timer før perioden slutter. Administrer eller avslutt når som helst i App Store-innstillingene."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Die Zahlung wird über deine Apple-ID abgerechnet. Abos verlängern sich automatisch, wenn sie nicht mindestens 24 Stunden vor Ablauf des Zeitraums gekündigt werden. Verwalten oder kündigen jederzeit in deinen App-Store-Einstellungen."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Il pagamento viene addebitato sul tuo ID Apple. Gli abbonamenti si rinnovano automaticamente se non vengono annullati almeno 24 ore prima della fine del periodo. Gestiscili o annullali quando vuoi nelle impostazioni dell'App Store."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Payment is charged to your Apple ID. Subscriptions renew automatically unless cancelled at least 24 hours before the period ends. Manage or cancel anytime in your App Store settings."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"O pagamento é cobrado no seu Apple ID. As assinaturas são renovadas automaticamente, a menos que sejam canceladas pelo menos 24 horas antes do fim do período. Gerencie ou cancele quando quiser nos ajustes da App Store."}}}},"hint_payment_is_charged_to_your_google":{"localizations":{"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"O pagamento é cobrado na sua conta do Google Play. As assinaturas são renovadas automaticamente, a menos que sejam canceladas. Gerencie ou cancele quando quiser na Play Store."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Payment is charged to your Google Play account. Subscriptions renew automatically unless cancelled. Manage or cancel anytime in the Play Store."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Betalingen trækkes på din Google Play-konto. Abonnementer fornyes automatisk, medmindre de opsiges. Administrer eller opsig når som helst i Play Butik."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Il pagamento viene addebitato sul tuo account Google Play. Gli abbonamenti si rinnovano automaticamente se non vengono annullati. Gestiscili o annullali quando vuoi nel Play Store."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"결제 금액은 Google Play 계정으로 청구됩니다. 취소하지 않으면 구독이 자동으로 갱신됩니다. 언제든지 Play 스토어에서 관리하거나 취소할 수 있습니다."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Betalingen belastes Google Play-kontoen din. Abonnementer fornyes automatisk med mindre de avsluttes. Administrer eller avslutt når som helst i Play Store."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Betalningen debiteras ditt Google Play-konto. Prenumerationer förnyas automatiskt om de inte avslutas. Hantera eller avsluta när som helst i Play Butik."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"お支払いはGoogle Playアカウントに請求されます。サブスクリプションは解約しない限り自動更新されます。Playストアでいつでも管理または解約できます。"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Оплата списывается с вашего аккаунта Google Play. Подписка продлевается автоматически, пока ее не отменят. Управлять подпиской или отменить ее можно в любое время в Play Store."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Płatność zostanie pobrana z Twojego konta Google Play. Subskrypcje odnawiają się automatycznie, chyba że zostaną anulowane. Zarządzaj nimi lub anuluj w dowolnym momencie w Sklepie Play."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Le paiement est débité sur votre compte Google Play. Les abonnements se renouvellent automatiquement sauf résiliation. Gérez-les ou résiliez-les à tout moment dans le Play Store."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"El pago se carga en tu cuenta de Google Play. Las suscripciones se renuevan automáticamente salvo que se cancelen. Gestiónalas o cancélalas cuando quieras en Play Store."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Die Zahlung wird über dein Google-Play-Konto abgerechnet. Abos verlängern sich automatisch, wenn sie nicht gekündigt werden. Verwalten oder kündigen jederzeit im Play Store."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"De betaling wordt in rekening gebracht via je Google Play-account. Abonnementen worden automatisch verlengd, tenzij je ze opzegt. Beheer of zeg op wanneer je wilt in de Play Store."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ödeme Google Play hesabından alınır. Abonelikler iptal edilmezse otomatik olarak yenilenir. Play Store'da istediğin zaman yönet veya iptal et."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"费用将从你的 Google Play 帐户扣除。除非取消，否则订阅将自动续订。可随时在 Play 商店中管理或取消。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"款項將從你的 Google Play 帳戶扣款。除非取消，否則訂閱會自動續訂。你可隨時在 Play 商店中管理或取消。"}}}},"hint_pick_accent_color_used_for":{"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"选择用于整个 App 中焦点高亮和图标的强调色。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"選擇整個 App 中焦點醒目提示和圖像所使用的強調色。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Välj accentfärgen för fokusmarkeringar och symboler i hela appen."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Uygulama genelinde odak vurguları ve simgeler için kullanılan vurgu rengini seç."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Выберите цвет акцента для выделения фокуса и значков во всем приложении."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"アプリ全体のフォーカスのハイライトとアイコンに使うアクセントカラーを選択します。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Escolha a cor de destaque usada nos destaques de foco e ícones em todo o app."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Pick the accent color used for focus highlights and icons throughout the app."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Vælg den accentfarve, der bruges til fokusmarkeringer og ikoner i hele appen."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Choisissez la couleur d'accentuation utilisée pour la mise en évidence et les icônes dans toute l'app."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"앱 전체에서 포커스 강조 표시와 아이콘에 사용할 강조 색상을 선택하세요."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Elige el color de acento que se usa para resaltar el foco y los iconos en toda la app."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Velg aksentfargen som brukes for fokusmarkering og ikoner i hele appen."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Scegli il colore di accento usato per l'evidenziazione del focus e le icone in tutta l'app."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Kies de accentkleur voor focusmarkeringen en symbolen in de hele app."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wähle die Akzentfarbe für Fokus-Hervorhebungen und Symbole in der ganzen App."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wybierz kolor akcentu używany do podświetleń fokusu i ikon w całej aplikacji."}}}},"hint_pick_app_theme_and_accent":{"localizations":{"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"앱 테마와 앱 전체에서 포커스 강조 표시와 아이콘에 사용할 강조 색상을 선택하세요."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Choisissez le thème de l'app et la couleur d'accentuation utilisée pour la mise en évidence et les icônes dans toute l'app."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Escolha o tema do app e a cor de destaque usada nos destaques de foco e ícones em todo o app."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wähle das App-Design und die Akzentfarbe für Fokus-Hervorhebungen und Symbole in der ganzen App."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Pick the app theme and the accent color used for focus highlights and icons throughout the app."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Elige el tema de la app y el color de acento que se usa para resaltar el foco y los iconos en toda la app."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"アプリのテーマと、アプリ全体のフォーカスのハイライトとアイコンに使うアクセントカラーを選択します。"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Выберите тему приложения и цвет акцента для выделения фокуса и значков во всем приложении."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Scegli il tema dell'app e il colore di accento usato per l'evidenziazione del focus e le icone in tutta l'app."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Vælg apptemaet og den accentfarve, der bruges til fokusmarkeringer og ikoner i hele appen."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Velg apptemaet og aksentfargen som brukes for fokusmarkering og ikoner i hele appen."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Kies het thema van de app en de accentkleur voor focusmarkeringen en symbolen in de hele app."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wybierz motyw aplikacji i kolor akcentu używany do podświetleń fokusu i ikon w całej aplikacji."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"選擇 App 主題，以及整個 App 中焦點醒目提示和圖像所使用的強調色。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Uygulama temasını ve uygulama genelinde odak vurguları ve simgeler için kullanılan vurgu rengini seç."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"选择 App 主题以及用于整个 App 中焦点高亮和图标的强调色。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Välj apptema och accentfärgen för fokusmarkeringar och symboler i hela appen."}}}},"hint_picked_on_this_device_from":{"localizations":{"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"依據你的播放、O 計數和評分，在此裝置上挑選。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"根据你的播放、O 计数和评分在此设备上挑选。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Utvalt på den här enheten utifrån dina uppspelningar, O-räknare och betyg."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Oynatmalarından, O Sayılarından ve puanlarından bu aygıtta seçildi."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Escolhidas neste dispositivo a partir das suas reproduções, contagens O e avaliações."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Op dit apparaat gekozen uit je weergaven, O-tellers en beoordelingen."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wybierane na tym urządzeniu na podstawie Twoich odtworzeń, liczników O i ocen."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Seleccionado en este dispositivo a partir de tus reproducciones, contadores O y valoraciones."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Valgt på denne enheten ut fra avspillinger, O-tellere og vurderinger."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Auf diesem Gerät aus deinen Wiedergaben, O-Zählern und Bewertungen ausgewählt."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"재생, O 카운트 및 별점을 바탕으로 이 기기에서 선택했습니다."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Scelte su questo dispositivo in base a riproduzioni, contatori O e valutazioni."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Udvalgt på denne enhed ud fra dine afspilninger, O-tællere og bedømmelser."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Picked on this device from your plays, O Counts and ratings."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Подобрано на этом устройстве по вашим воспроизведениям, O и рейтингам."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"再生、Oカウント、評価をもとにこのデバイスで選ばれます。"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Sélectionnées sur cet appareil à partir de vos lectures, compteurs O et notes."}}}},"hint_pick_performer_to_start_rise":{"localizations":{"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Velg en utøver for å starte Rise-runden"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Rise 진행을 시작할 배우를 선택하세요"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Riseランを開始する出演者を選択"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Kies een performer om de Rise-run te starten"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Pick a performer to start the Rise run"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Vælg en kunstner for at starte Rise-runden"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Escolha um artista para iniciar a rodada Rise"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wähle einen Darsteller, um den Rise-Lauf zu starten"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Elige un intérprete para empezar la partida de Rise"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wybierz aktora, aby rozpocząć rundę Rise"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Выберите исполнителя, чтобы начать забег Rise"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Scegli un performer per iniziare la partita Rise"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Choisissez un performeur pour lancer la partie Rise"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Rise turunu başlatmak için bir oyuncu seç"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Välj en stjärna för att starta Rise-omgången"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"选择一位演员开始 Rise 回合"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"選擇一位演員以開始 Rise 回合"}}}},"hint_play_count_history_resume_point":{"localizations":{"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Antal visningar, historik, återupptagningspunkt och visningstid på servern. Spelarmenyn kan pausa det för en scen."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"伺服器上的播放次數、紀錄、續播位置和觀看時間。播放器選單可針對單一短片暫停記錄。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Sunucudaki oynatma sayısı, geçmiş, devam noktası ve izleme süresi. Oynatıcı menüsü bunu bir sahne için duraklatabilir."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"服务器上的播放次数、历史记录、续播位置和观看时长。可通过播放器菜单对单个短片暂停记录。"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Afspeelaantal, geschiedenis, hervatpunt en kijktijd op de server. Het spelermenu kan dit voor één scène pauzeren."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Antal afspilninger, historik, genoptagelsespunkt og afspilningstid på serveren. Afspillermenuen kan sætte det på pause for én scene."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Число воспроизведений, история, точка продолжения и время просмотра на сервере. В меню плеера это можно приостановить для одной сцены."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Nombre de lectures, historique, point de reprise et durée de visionnage sur le serveur. Le menu du lecteur permet de le suspendre pour une scène."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Número de reproducciones, historial, punto de reanudación y tiempo de reproducción en el servidor. El menú del reproductor puede pausarlo para una escena."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Play count, history, resume point and watch time on the server. The player menu can pause it for one scene."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Liczba odtworzeń, historia, punkt wznowienia i czas oglądania na serwerze. Menu odtwarzacza może to wstrzymać dla jednej sceny."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Numero di riproduzioni, cronologia, punto di ripresa e tempo di visione sul server. Il menu del player può sospenderli per una scena."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wiedergaben, Verlauf, Fortsetzungspunkt und Wiedergabezeit auf dem Server. Im Player-Menü lässt es sich für eine Szene pausieren."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Contagem de reproduções, histórico, ponto de retomada e tempo assistido no servidor. O menu do player pode pausar isso para uma cena."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Antall avspillinger, historikk, gjenopptakingspunkt og seertid på serveren. Spillermenyen kan sette det på pause for én scene."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"서버의 재생 횟수, 기록, 이어서 재생 위치 및 시청 시간입니다. 플레이어 메뉴에서 영상 하나에 대해 일시 중지할 수 있습니다."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"再生回数、履歴、再開位置、再生時間をサーバーに記録します。プレーヤーメニューで1つのシーンだけ一時停止できます。"}}}},"hint_plays_scenes_back_to_back":{"localizations":{"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Lit les scènes à la suite depuis une rangée de l'accueil : sorties récentes, ajouts récents ou vos filtres de scènes enregistrés. Les pages de performeur, studio, étiquette et groupe ont leur propre chaîne."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Reproduce escenas una tras otra desde una fila de Inicio: estrenadas recientemente, añadidas recientemente o tus filtros de escenas guardados. Las páginas de intérpretes, estudios, etiquetas y grupos tienen su propio canal."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Afspiller scener efter hinanden fra en række på Hjem: senest udgivet, senest tilføjet eller dine gemte scenefiltre. Sider for kunstnere, studier, tags og grupper får deres egen kanal."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ホームの行からシーンを連続再生します：最近リリース、最近追加、または保存済みシーンフィルター。出演者、スタジオ、タグ、グループのページにはそれぞれ専用のチャンネルがあります。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Spielt Szenen nacheinander aus einer Zeile auf Start: kürzlich erschienen, kürzlich hinzugefügt oder deine gespeicherten Szenenfilter. Darsteller-, Studio-, Tag- und Gruppenseiten haben einen eigenen Kanal."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Spiller scener etter hverandre fra en rad på Hjem: nylig utgitt, nylig lagt til eller de lagrede scenefiltrene dine. Utøver-, studio-, tagg- og gruppesider får sin egen kanal."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Spelar scener i följd från en rad på Hem: nyligen släppta, nyligen tillagda eller dina sparade scenfilter. Sidor för stjärnor, studior, taggar och grupper får en egen kanal."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Reproduz cenas em sequência a partir de uma linha do Início: lançadas recentemente, adicionadas recentemente ou seus filtros salvos de cenas. Páginas de artistas, estúdios, etiquetas e grupos têm seu próprio canal."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Speelt scènes achter elkaar af uit een rij op Home: recent uitgebracht, recent toegevoegd of je bewaarde scènefilters. Pagina's van performers, studio's, labels en groepen krijgen hun eigen kanaal."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Riproduce scene una dopo l'altra da una riga della Home: uscite di recente, aggiunte di recente o i tuoi filtri scene salvati. Le pagine di performer, studi, tag e gruppi hanno il loro canale."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"홈의 행(최근 공개, 최근 추가 또는 저장된 영상 필터)에서 영상을 연속으로 재생합니다. 배우, 스튜디오, 태그 및 그룹 페이지에는 자체 채널이 있습니다."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Plays scenes back to back from a row on Home: recently released, recently added or your saved scene filters. Performer, studio, tag and group pages get their own channel."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Odtwarza sceny jedna po drugiej z wiersza ekranu Start: ostatnio wydane, ostatnio dodane lub Twoje zapisane filtry scen. Strony aktorów, studiów, tagów i grup mają własny kanał."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Воспроизводит подряд сцены из ряда главной: недавно вышедшие, недавно добавленные или ваши сохраненные фильтры сцен. У страниц исполнителей, студий, тегов и групп — свой канал."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ana Sayfa'daki bir satırdan sahneleri art arda oynatır: son çıkanlar, son eklenenler veya kayıtlı sahne filtrelerin. Oyuncu, stüdyo, etiket ve grup sayfalarının kendi kanalı olur."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"從首頁的某一列連續播放短片：最近發行、最近加入或你已儲存的短片篩選條件。演員、工作室、標籤和群組頁面也有各自的頻道。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"连续播放主页某一行中的短片：最近发行、最近添加或你的已存短片过滤器。演员、工作室、标签和集合页面有各自的频道。"}}}},"hint_please_configure_your_stash_server":{"localizations":{"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Başlamak için Stash sunucunu yapılandır."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"请配置你的 Stash 服务器以开始使用。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"請設定你的 Stash 伺服器以開始使用。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Konfigurera din Stash-server för att komma igång."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Configure seu servidor Stash para começar."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Richte deinen Stash-Server ein, um loszulegen."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Konfigurer din Stash-server for at komme i gang."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Konfigurer Stash-serveren din for å komme i gang."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stel je Stash-server in om te beginnen."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Configurez votre serveur Stash pour commencer."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Для начала настройте сервер Stash."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Configura tu servidor Stash para empezar."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"시작하려면 Stash 서버를 구성하세요."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Skonfiguruj serwer Stash, aby rozpocząć."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Please configure your Stash server to get started."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Configura il tuo server Stash per iniziare."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"始めるにはStashサーバーを設定してください。"}}}},"hint_please_enable_dashboard_performers_studios":{"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Aktiviere Dashboard, Darsteller, Studios, Tags, Gruppen oder Marker in den Einstellungen"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"설정에서 Dashboard, 배우, 스튜디오, 태그, 그룹 또는 마커를 활성화하세요"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"設定でDashboard、出演者、スタジオ、タグ、グループ、マーカーのいずれかを有効にしてください"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Slå Dashboard, Kunstnere, Studier, Tags, Grupper eller Markører til i Indstillinger"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Slå på Dashboard, Utøvere, Studioer, Tagger, Grupper eller Markører i Innstillinger"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Aktivera Dashboard, Stjärnor, Studior, Taggar, Grupper eller Markörer i Inställningar"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Activez Dashboard, Performeurs, Studios, Étiquettes, Groupes ou Marqueurs dans les réglages"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Activa Dashboard, Intérpretes, Estudios, Etiquetas, Grupos o Marcadores en Ajustes"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Schakel Dashboard, Performers, Studio's, Labels, Groepen of Markeringen in bij Instellingen"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Attiva Dashboard, Performer, Studi, Tag, Gruppi o Marcatori in Impostazioni"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ative Dashboard, Artistas, Estúdios, Etiquetas, Grupos ou Marcadores em Ajustes"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Включите в настройках Dashboard, исполнителей, студии, теги, группы или маркеры"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Please enable Dashboard, Performers, Studios, Tags, Groups or Markers in Settings"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Włącz w Ustawieniach Dashboard, Aktorów, Studia, Tagi, Grupy lub Znaczniki"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"请在设置中启用 Dashboard、演员、工作室、标签、集合或标记"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"請在「設定」中啟用 Dashboard、演員、工作室、標籤、群組或標記"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ayarlar'da Dashboard, Oyuncular, Stüdyolar, Etiketler, Gruplar veya İşaretçiler'i aç"}}}},"hint_premium_features_including_channels_continuous":{"localizations":{"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Kanallar dahil premium özellikler — bir oyuncu, stüdyo, etiket veya kayıtlı filtrenin kesintisiz oynatılması."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Premiumfunktioner, bland annat Kanaler – kontinuerlig uppspelning av en stjärna, studio, tagg eller ett sparat filter."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"進階功能，包括頻道 — 連續播放某位演員、工作室、標籤或已儲存篩選條件的內容。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"高级功能，包括频道 — 连续播放某位演员、工作室、标签或已存过滤器的内容。"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Premiumfuncties, waaronder Kanalen – doorlopend afspelen van een performer, studio, label of bewaard filter."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Премиум-функции, включая каналы — непрерывное воспроизведение исполнителя, студии, тега или сохраненного фильтра."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Funkcje premium, w tym kanały — ciągłe odtwarzanie aktora, studia, tagu lub zapisanego filtra."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Premium-Funktionen, darunter Kanäle – fortlaufende Wiedergabe eines Darstellers, Studios, Tags oder gespeicherten Filters."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"チャンネル（出演者、スタジオ、タグ、保存済みフィルターの連続再生）などのプレミアム機能。"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Premiumfunktioner, herunder Kanaler – fortløbende afspilning af en kunstner, et studie, et tag eller et gemt filter."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Fonctions premium, dont les chaînes — lecture continue d'un performeur, studio, étiquette ou filtre enregistré."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"채널(배우, 스튜디오, 태그 또는 저장된 필터의 연속 재생)을 포함한 프리미엄 기능."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Premiumfunksjoner, inkludert kanaler – kontinuerlig avspilling av en utøver, et studio, en tagg eller et lagret filter."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Funciones premium, como Canales: reproducción continua de un intérprete, estudio, etiqueta o filtro guardado."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Funzioni premium, inclusi i Canali: riproduzione continua di un performer, studio, tag o filtro salvato."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Recursos premium, incluindo Canais — reprodução contínua de um artista, estúdio, etiqueta ou filtro salvo."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Premium features, including Channels — continuous playback of a performer, studio, tag or saved filter."}}}},"hint_purchase_pending_it_unlocks_once":{"localizations":{"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Acquisto in sospeso: verrà sbloccato al completamento del pagamento."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Kjøpet venter – det låses opp når betalingen er fullført."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Zakup oczekuje — zostanie odblokowany po zakończeniu płatności."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"購入は保留中です — 支払いが完了するとロック解除されます。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"구입 대기 중 — 결제가 완료되면 잠금 해제됩니다."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Compra pendente — será desbloqueado quando o pagamento for concluído."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Compra pendiente: se desbloqueará cuando se complete el pago."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Achat en attente — le déblocage a lieu une fois le paiement effectué."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Kauf ausstehend – wird freigeschaltet, sobald die Zahlung abgeschlossen ist."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Покупка ожидает — доступ откроется после оплаты."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Purchase pending — it unlocks once payment completes."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Aankoop in behandeling – wordt ontgrendeld zodra de betaling is voltooid."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Købet afventer – det låses op, når betalingen er gennemført."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"购买待处理 — 付款完成后即可解锁。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Köpet väntar – det låses upp när betalningen är klar."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Satın alma bekliyor — ödeme tamamlanınca kilidi açılır."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"購買處理中 — 付款完成後即會解鎖。"}}}},"hint_puts_performers_against_each_other":{"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在“工具”中让演员两两对决。你选出胜者，其评分会在你的服务器上更新。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Araçlar'da oyuncuları karşı karşıya getirir. Kazananı sen seçersin ve puanları sunucunda güncellenir."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在「工具」中讓演員互相對決。由你選出勝者，其評分會在你的伺服器上更新。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ställer stjärnor mot varandra i Verktyg. Du väljer vinnaren och deras betyg uppdateras på servern."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Setter utøvere opp mot hverandre i Verktøy. Du velger vinneren, og vurderingene oppdateres på serveren."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Lässt in Werkzeuge Darsteller gegeneinander antreten. Du wählst den Gewinner, und ihre Bewertungen werden auf deinem Server aktualisiert."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Mette i performer uno contro l'altro in Strumenti. Scegli tu il vincitore e le loro valutazioni vengono aggiornate sul server."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Puts performers against each other in Tools. You pick the winner and their ratings update on your server."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Zestawia aktorów ze sobą w Narzędziach. Wybierasz zwycięzcę, a ich oceny aktualizują się na serwerze."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Enfrenta a intérpretes entre sí en Herramientas. Tú eliges al ganador y sus valoraciones se actualizan en tu servidor."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Sætter kunstnere op mod hinanden i Værktøjer. Du vælger vinderen, og deres bedømmelser opdateres på din server."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Сталкивает исполнителей друг с другом в «Инструментах». Вы выбираете победителя, а их рейтинги обновляются на сервере."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Coloca artistas uns contra os outros em Ferramentas. Você escolhe o vencedor e as avaliações deles são atualizadas no seu servidor."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"도구에서 배우끼리 대결시킵니다. 승자를 고르면 서버의 별점이 업데이트됩니다."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Zet performers tegen elkaar op in Tools. Jij kiest de winnaar en hun beoordelingen worden op je server bijgewerkt."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Oppose des performeurs les uns aux autres dans Outils. Vous choisissez le gagnant et leurs notes sont mises à jour sur votre serveur."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ツールで出演者同士を対戦させます。勝者を選ぶと、サーバー上の評価が更新されます。"}}}},"hint_puts_performers_against_each_other_under":{"localizations":{"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Coloca artistas uns contra os outros em Descobrir. Você escolhe o vencedor e as avaliações deles são atualizadas no seu servidor."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Zet performers tegen elkaar op onder Ontdek. Jij kiest de winnaar en hun beoordelingen worden op je server bijgewerkt."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Setter utøvere opp mot hverandre under Utforsk. Du velger vinneren, og vurderingene oppdateres på serveren."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Zestawia aktorów ze sobą w sekcji Odkrywaj. Wybierasz zwycięzcę, a ich oceny aktualizują się na serwerze."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Lässt unter Entdecken Darsteller gegeneinander antreten. Du wählst den Gewinner, und ihre Bewertungen werden auf deinem Server aktualisiert."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Sætter kunstnere op mod hinanden under Opdag. Du vælger vinderen, og deres bedømmelser opdateres på din server."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"「見つける」で出演者同士を対戦させます。勝者を選ぶと、サーバー上の評価が更新されます。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"둘러보기에서 배우끼리 대결시킵니다. 승자를 고르면 서버의 별점이 업데이트됩니다."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Mette i performer uno contro l'altro in Scopri. Scegli tu il vincitore e le loro valutazioni vengono aggiornate sul server."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Сталкивает исполнителей друг с другом в разделе «Открытия». Вы выбираете победителя, а их рейтинги обновляются на сервере."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Enfrenta a intérpretes entre sí en Descubrir. Tú eliges al ganador y sus valoraciones se actualizan en tu servidor."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Puts performers against each other under Discover. You pick the winner and their ratings update on your server."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Oppose des performeurs les uns aux autres dans Découvrir. Vous choisissez le gagnant et leurs notes sont mises à jour sur votre serveur."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Keşfet altında oyuncuları karşı karşıya getirir. Kazananı sen seçersin ve puanları sunucunda güncellenir."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在“发现”中让演员两两对决。你选出胜者，其评分会在你的服务器上更新。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ställer stjärnor mot varandra under Upptäck. Du väljer vinnaren och deras betyg uppdateras på servern."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在「探索」中讓演員互相對決。由你選出勝者，其評分會在你的伺服器上更新。"}}}},"hint_ranks_your_top_scenes_performers":{"localizations":{"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Rangordnar dina främsta scener, stjärnor, studior och taggar i Verktyg, efter mått som O-räknare eller betyg."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在「工具」中依 O 計數或評分等指標，為你最常看的短片、演員、工作室和標籤排名。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在“工具”中按 O 计数或评分等指标为你的热门短片、演员、工作室和标签排名。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Araçlar'da en iyi sahnelerini, oyuncularını, stüdyolarını ve etiketlerini O Sayısı veya puan gibi ölçülere göre sıralar."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Tworzy w Narzędziach rankingi Twoich najlepszych scen, aktorów, studiów i tagów według miar takich jak licznik O czy ocena."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Classe vos meilleurs scènes, performeurs, studios et étiquettes dans Outils, selon des critères comme le compteur O ou la note."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ranks your top scenes, performers, studios and tags in Tools, by measures like O Count or rating."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Rangerer de beste scenene, utøverne, studioene og taggene dine i Verktøy, etter mål som O-teller eller vurdering."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Oカウントや評価などの指標で、トップのシーン、出演者、スタジオ、タグをツールでランキング表示します。"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Clasifica tus escenas, intérpretes, estudios y etiquetas favoritos en Herramientas según medidas como el contador O o la valoración."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Rankt deine Top-Szenen, -Darsteller, -Studios und -Tags in Werkzeuge, nach Maßen wie O-Zähler oder Bewertung."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Составляет в «Инструментах» рейтинги ваших лучших сцен, исполнителей, студий и тегов — по счетчику O, рейтингу и другим показателям."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Classifica le tue scene, performer, studi e tag migliori in Strumenti, per criteri come contatore O o valutazione."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"도구에서 O 카운트나 별점 등의 기준으로 상위 영상, 배우, 스튜디오 및 태그의 순위를 매깁니다."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Classifica suas principais cenas, artistas, estúdios e etiquetas em Ferramentas, por critérios como contagem O ou avaliação."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Rangerer dine topscener, -kunstnere, -studier og -tags i Værktøjer efter mål som O-tæller eller bedømmelse."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Rangschikt je topscènes, -performers, -studio's en -labels in Tools, op maatstaven zoals O-teller of beoordeling."}}}},"hint_ratings_that_were_not_saved":{"localizations":{"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Несохраненные рейтинги будут потеряны."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Niezapisane oceny zostaną utracone."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Vurderinger som ikke ble lagret, går tapt."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Avaliações que não foram salvas serão perdidas."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Le valutazioni non salvate andranno perse."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"保存されていない評価は失われます。"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Les notes non enregistrées sont perdues."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Beoordelingen die niet zijn bewaard, gaan verloren."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"저장되지 않은 별점은 사라집니다."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ratings that were not saved are lost."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Las valoraciones que no se guardaron se pierden."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Bedømmelser, der ikke blev gemt, går tabt."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Nicht gespeicherte Bewertungen gehen verloren."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"未儲存的評分將會遺失。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"未存储的评分将会丢失。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Kaydedilmeyen puanlar kaybolur."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Betyg som inte sparades går förlorade."}}}},"hint_remove_arg_from_stash_other":{"localizations":{"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"要從 Stash 移除「%@」嗎？其他裝置將失去此已儲存的篩選條件。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"要从 Stash 中移除“%@”吗？其他设备将失去此已存过滤器。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"“%@” Stash'ten kaldırılsın mı? Diğer aygıtlar bu kayıtlı filtreyi kaybeder."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"「%@」をStashから削除しますか？他のデバイスでもこの保存済みフィルターが使えなくなります。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"„%@“ aus Stash entfernen? Andere Geräte verlieren diesen gespeicherten Filter."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Remover “%@” do Stash? Outros dispositivos perderão este filtro salvo."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash에서 “%@”을(를) 제거하겠습니까? 다른 기기에서도 이 저장된 필터가 사라집니다."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Usunąć „%@” ze Stash? Inne urządzenia stracą ten zapisany filtr."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ta bort ”%@” från Stash? Andra enheter förlorar det här sparade filtret."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"¿Quitar «%@» de Stash? Los demás dispositivos perderán este filtro guardado."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"'%@' uit Stash verwijderen? Andere apparaten verliezen dit bewaarde filter."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Retirer « %@ » de Stash ? Les autres appareils perdront ce filtre enregistré."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Удалить «%@» из Stash? На других устройствах этот сохраненный фильтр тоже пропадет."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Remove “%@” from Stash? Other devices will lose this saved filter."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Fjern “%@” fra Stash? Andre enheder mister dette gemte filter."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Rimuovere “%@” da Stash? Gli altri dispositivi perderanno questo filtro salvato."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Fjerne «%@» fra Stash? Andre enheter mister dette lagrede filteret."}}}},"hint_remove_arg_from_this_device":{"localizations":{"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"¿Quitar «%@» de este dispositivo? Esta acción no se puede deshacer."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Удалить «%@» с этого устройства? Это действие нельзя отменить."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Remover “%@” deste dispositivo? Não é possível desfazer."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"「%@」をこのデバイスから削除しますか？この操作は取り消せません。"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"'%@' van dit apparaat verwijderen? Dit kan niet ongedaan worden gemaakt."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Fjerne «%@» fra denne enheten? Dette kan ikke angres."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"이 기기에서 “%@”을(를) 제거하겠습니까? 이 작업은 실행 취소할 수 없습니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Retirer « %@ » de cet appareil ? Cette action est irréversible."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Fjern “%@” fra denne enhed? Det kan ikke fortrydes."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"„%@“ von diesem Gerät entfernen? Das kann nicht rückgängig gemacht werden."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Rimuovere “%@” da questo dispositivo? Questa azione non può essere annullata."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Remove “%@” from this device? This cannot be undone."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Usunąć „%@” z tego urządzenia? Tej operacji nie można cofnąć."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"要從此裝置移除「%@」嗎？此動作無法還原。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"要从此设备中移除“%@”吗？此操作无法撤销。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"“%@” bu aygıttan kaldırılsın mı? Bu işlem geri alınamaz."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ta bort ”%@” från den här enheten? Det går inte att ångra."}}}},"hint_removes_arg_from_dashboard_saved":{"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"从 Dashboard 中移除“%@”。已存过滤器本身仍保留在服务器上。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"“%@” Dashboard'dan kaldırılır. Kayıtlı filtrenin kendisi sunucuda kalır."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Tar bort ”%@” från Dashboard. Själva det sparade filtret finns kvar på servern."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"從 Dashboard 移除「%@」。已儲存的篩選條件本身仍會保留在伺服器上。"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"「%@」をDashboardから削除します。保存済みフィルター自体はサーバーに残ります。"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Fjerner «%@» fra Dashboard. Selve det lagrede filteret blir værende på serveren."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dashboard에서 \"%@\"을(를) 제거합니다. 저장된 필터 자체는 서버에 남아 있습니다."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Usuwa „%@” z Dashboardu. Sam zapisany filtr pozostaje na serwerze."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Rimuove \"%@\" dalla dashboard. Il filtro salvato resta sul server."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Removes \"%@\" from the dashboard. The saved filter itself stays on the server."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Verwijdert '%@' van het dashboard. Het bewaarde filter zelf blijft op de server."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Убирает «%@» с Dashboard. Сам сохраненный фильтр остается на сервере."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Entfernt „%@“ aus dem Dashboard. Der gespeicherte Filter selbst bleibt auf dem Server."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Fjerner \"%@\" fra Dashboard. Selve det gemte filter bliver på serveren."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Retire « %@ » du Dashboard. Le filtre enregistré reste sur le serveur."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Quita «%@» del Dashboard. El filtro guardado sigue en el servidor."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Remove \"%@\" do Dashboard. O filtro salvo em si continua no servidor."}}}},"hint_removes_cached_artwork_for_active":{"localizations":{"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Fjerner de bufrede bildene for den aktive serveren. Bildene lastes ned på nytt når de vises."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"활성 서버의 캐시된 아트워크를 제거합니다. 이미지는 표시될 때 다시 다운로드됩니다."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Elimina las imágenes en caché del servidor activo. Se vuelven a descargar cuando aparecen."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Supprime les illustrations en cache du serveur actif. Les images sont retéléchargées lorsqu'elles apparaissent."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Remove as imagens em cache do servidor ativo. As imagens são baixadas novamente quando aparecerem."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"使用中のサーバーのキャッシュ画像を削除します。画像は表示されるときに再ダウンロードされます。"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Usuwa zapisane grafiki aktywnego serwera. Obrazy zostaną ponownie pobrane, gdy się pojawią."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Rimuove le immagini in cache del server attivo. Le immagini vengono riscaricate quando appaiono."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Tar bort cachade bilder för den aktiva servern. Bilderna laddas ner igen när de visas."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Entfernt die zwischengespeicherten Bilder des aktiven Servers. Bilder werden beim Anzeigen neu geladen."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Удаляет кэш изображений активного сервера. Изображения будут загружены снова при появлении."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Fjerner de cachelagrede billeder for den aktive server. Billederne downloades igen, når de vises."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Removes the cached artwork for the active server. Images are downloaded again as they appear."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Verwijdert de bewaarde illustraties voor de actieve server. Afbeeldingen worden opnieuw gedownload zodra ze verschijnen."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Etkin sunucunun önbelleğe alınmış görsellerini kaldırır. Resimler göründükçe yeniden indirilir."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"移除使用中伺服器的快取插圖。圖片會在顯示時重新下載。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"移除当前服务器的缓存图片。图片再次出现时会重新下载。"}}}},"hint_removes_downloaded_speech_models_and":{"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"移除已下载的语音模型和翻译包。AI 字幕会在需要时重新下载它们。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"İndirilen konuşma modellerini ve çeviri paketlerini kaldırır. AI altyazılar gerektiğinde bunları yeniden indirir."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"移除已下載的語音模型和翻譯套件。AI 字幕會在需要時重新下載。"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Fjerner de downloadede talemodeller og oversættelsespakker. AI-undertekster downloader dem igen efter behov."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Removes the downloaded speech models and translation packs. AI subtitles download them again when needed."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"다운로드한 음성 모델과 번역 팩을 제거합니다. AI 자막이 필요할 때 다시 다운로드합니다."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Usuwa pobrane modele mowy i pakiety tłumaczeń. Napisy AI pobiorą je ponownie w razie potrzeby."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ダウンロード済みの音声モデルと翻訳パックを削除します。AI字幕は必要に応じて再ダウンロードします。"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Elimina los modelos de voz y los paquetes de traducción descargados. Los subtítulos con IA los vuelven a descargar cuando hace falta."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Entfernt die geladenen Sprachmodelle und Übersetzungspakete. KI-Untertitel laden sie bei Bedarf erneut."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Supprime les modèles vocaux et packs de traduction téléchargés. Les sous-titres IA les retéléchargent au besoin."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Verwijdert de gedownloade spraakmodellen en vertaalpakketten. AI-ondertiteling downloadt ze opnieuw wanneer nodig."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Remove os modelos de fala e pacotes de tradução baixados. As legendas por IA os baixam novamente quando necessário."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Удаляет загруженные речевые модели и пакеты перевода. ИИ-субтитры загрузят их снова при необходимости."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Rimuove i modelli vocali e i pacchetti di traduzione scaricati. I sottotitoli IA li riscaricano quando servono."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Fjerner nedlastede talemodeller og oversettelsespakker. AI-undertekster laster dem ned igjen ved behov."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Tar bort nedladdade talmodeller och översättningspaket. AI-undertexter laddar ner dem igen vid behov."}}}},"hint_removes_scenes_images_and_galleries":{"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ファイルが存在しなくなったシーン、画像、ギャラリーを、生成されたファイルとともに削除します。この操作は取り消せません。ドライランではサーバーログへの書き込みのみ行います。"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Удаляет сцены, изображения и галереи, файлов которых больше нет, вместе с их сгенерированными файлами. Это действие нельзя отменить. Пробный запуск только пишет в журнал сервера."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Fjerner scener, bilder og gallerier der filene ikke lenger finnes, sammen med de genererte filene. Dette kan ikke angres. En prøvekjøring skriver bare til serverloggen."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Entfernt Szenen, Bilder und Galerien, deren Dateien nicht mehr existieren, samt ihren generierten Dateien. Das kann nicht rückgängig gemacht werden. Ein Probelauf schreibt nur ins Server-Log."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Rimuove scene, immagini e gallerie i cui file non esistono più, insieme ai file generati. Questa azione non può essere annullata. Una simulazione scrive solo nel log del server."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"파일이 더 이상 존재하지 않는 영상, 이미지 및 갤러리를 생성된 파일과 함께 제거합니다. 이 작업은 실행 취소할 수 없습니다. 테스트 실행은 서버 로그에만 기록합니다."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Verwijdert scènes, afbeeldingen en galerijen waarvan de bestanden niet meer bestaan, met hun gegenereerde bestanden. Dit kan niet ongedaan worden gemaakt. Een proefrun schrijft alleen naar het serverlogboek."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Supprime les scènes, images et galeries dont les fichiers n'existent plus, ainsi que leurs fichiers générés. Cette action est irréversible. Une simulation écrit seulement dans le journal du serveur."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Fjerner scener, billeder og gallerier, hvis filer ikke længere findes, sammen med deres genererede filer. Det kan ikke fortrydes. En prøvekørsel skriver kun til serverloggen."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Usuwa sceny, obrazy i galerie, których pliki już nie istnieją, wraz z wygenerowanymi plikami. Tej operacji nie można cofnąć. Próba na sucho zapisuje tylko w dzienniku serwera."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Remove cenas, imagens e galerias cujos arquivos não existem mais, junto com seus arquivos gerados. Não é possível desfazer. Uma simulação apenas escreve no log do servidor."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Removes scenes, images and galleries whose files no longer exist, with their generated files. This cannot be undone. A dry run only writes to the server log."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Elimina escenas, imágenes y galerías cuyos archivos ya no existen, junto con sus archivos generados. Esta acción no se puede deshacer. Una simulación solo escribe en el registro del servidor."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"移除檔案已不存在的短片、圖片和圖庫，以及其產生的檔案。此動作無法還原。試執行只會寫入伺服器日誌。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dosyaları artık bulunmayan sahneleri, resimleri ve galerileri, oluşturulan dosyalarıyla birlikte kaldırır. Bu işlem geri alınamaz. Deneme çalıştırması yalnızca sunucu günlüğüne yazar."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"移除文件已不存在的短片、图片和图库及其生成的文件。此操作无法撤销。试运行只会写入服务器日志。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Tar bort scener, bilder och gallerier vars filer inte längre finns, tillsammans med deras genererade filer. Det går inte att ångra. En testkörning skriver bara till serverloggen."}}}},"hint_remove_this_filter_this_cannot":{"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"要移除此过滤器吗？此操作无法撤销。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"要移除此篩選條件嗎？此動作無法還原。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ta bort det här filtret? Det går inte att ångra."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Bu filtre kaldırılsın mı? Bu işlem geri alınamaz."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"このフィルターを削除しますか？この操作は取り消せません。"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Fjern dette filter? Det kan ikke fortrydes."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"이 필터를 제거하겠습니까? 이 작업은 실행 취소할 수 없습니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Retirer ce filtre ? Cette action est irréversible."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Rimuovere questo filtro? Questa azione non può essere annullata."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Diesen Filter entfernen? Das kann nicht rückgängig gemacht werden."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Usunąć ten filtr? Tej operacji nie można cofnąć."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Fjerne dette filteret? Dette kan ikke angres."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Remove this filter? This cannot be undone."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Remover este filtro? Não é possível desfazer."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Удалить этот фильтр? Это действие нельзя отменить."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dit filter verwijderen? Dit kan niet ongedaan worden gemaakt."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"¿Quitar este filtro? Esta acción no se puede deshacer."}}}},"hint_renames_selected_stash_saved_filter":{"localizations":{"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Переименовывает выбранный сохраненный фильтр Stash или фильтр на устройстве."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Benennt den gewählten gespeicherten Stash-Filter oder Gerätefilter um."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"選択したStashの保存済みフィルターまたはデバイス上のフィルターの名前を変更します。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Byter namn på valt sparat Stash-filter eller filter på enheten."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wijzigt de naam van het geselecteerde bewaarde Stash-filter of apparaatfilter."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Omdøber det valgte gemte Stash-filter eller filter på enheden."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Gir det valgte lagrede Stash-filteret eller filteret på enheten nytt navn."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Renomme le filtre enregistré Stash ou le filtre local sélectionné."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Renomeia o filtro salvo do Stash ou o filtro do dispositivo selecionado."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Renames the selected Stash saved filter or on-device filter."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Rinomina il filtro salvato di Stash o il filtro sul dispositivo selezionato."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Renombra el filtro guardado de Stash o el filtro del dispositivo seleccionado."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"선택한 Stash 저장된 필터 또는 기기 내 필터의 이름을 변경합니다."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Zmienia nazwę wybranego zapisanego filtra Stash lub filtra na urządzeniu."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Seçili Stash kayıtlı filtresini veya aygıttaki filtreyi yeniden adlandırır."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"重命名所选的 Stash 已存过滤器或设备上的过滤器。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"重新命名所選的 Stash 已儲存篩選條件或裝置上的篩選條件。"}}}},"hint_rename_this_preset_or_saved":{"localizations":{"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Byt namn på förinställningen eller det sparade filtret."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"重新命名此預設組合或已儲存的篩選條件。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Bu hazır ayarı veya kayıtlı filtreyi yeniden adlandır."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"重命名此预设或已存过滤器。"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Zmień nazwę tego ustawienia wstępnego lub zapisanego filtra."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Renombra este preajuste o filtro guardado."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Renomeie esta predefinição ou filtro salvo."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Gi denne forhåndsinnstillingen eller det lagrede filteret nytt navn."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wijzig de naam van deze voorinstelling of dit bewaarde filter."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dieses Preset oder diesen gespeicherten Filter umbenennen."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"이 프리셋 또는 저장된 필터의 이름을 변경합니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Renommez ce préréglage ou ce filtre enregistré."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Rename this preset or saved filter."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Rinomina questo preset o filtro salvato."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Переименуйте этот шаблон или сохраненный фильтр."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Omdøb denne forudindstilling eller dette gemte filter."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"このプリセットまたは保存済みフィルターの名前を変更します。"}}}},"hint_require_pin_before_app_opens":{"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Vor dem Öffnen der App eine PIN verlangen."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Exigir um PIN antes de o app abrir."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"アプリを開く前にPINを要求します。"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Pedir un PIN antes de abrir la app."}},"ru":{"stringUnit"