,"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash rechaza las IP públicas mientras no tenga credenciales. Define un usuario y una contraseña en Stash o permite esta IP con public_whitelist."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash odrzuca publiczne adresy IP, dopóki nie ma danych logowania. Ustaw nazwę użytkownika i hasło w Stash lub zezwól na ten adres IP przez public_whitelist."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash rifiuta gli IP pubblici finché non ha credenziali. Imposta nome utente e password in Stash o consenti questo IP con public_whitelist."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash afviser offentlige IP-adresser, så længe der ikke er loginoplysninger. Angiv et brugernavn og en adgangskode i Stash, eller tillad denne IP med public_whitelist."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash refuses public IPs while it has no credentials. Set a username and password in Stash, or allow this IP with public_whitelist."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash avvisar publika IP-adresser så länge inga inloggningsuppgifter finns. Ange ett användarnamn och lösenord i Stash eller tillåt IP-adressen med public_whitelist."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stashは認証情報が設定されていない間、パブリックIPからの接続を拒否します。Stashでユーザー名とパスワードを設定するか、public_whitelistでこのIPを許可してください。"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash refuse les IP publiques tant qu'aucun identifiant n'est défini. Définissez un nom d'utilisateur et un mot de passe dans Stash, ou autorisez cette IP avec public_whitelist."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash отклоняет публичные IP, пока у него нет учетных данных. Задайте имя пользователя и пароль в Stash или разрешите этот IP через public_whitelist."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash lehnt öffentliche IPs ab, solange keine Zugangsdaten gesetzt sind. Lege in Stash Benutzername und Passwort fest oder erlaube diese IP mit public_whitelist."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash weigert openbare IP-adressen zolang er geen inloggegevens zijn. Stel een gebruikersnaam en wachtwoord in Stash in, of sta dit IP-adres toe met public_whitelist."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"O Stash recusa IPs públicos enquanto não tiver credenciais. Defina um usuário e senha no Stash ou permita este IP com public_whitelist."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash 在未設定帳號密碼時會拒絕公用 IP。請在 Stash 中設定使用者名稱和密碼，或以 public_whitelist 允許此 IP。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash, kimlik bilgisi olmadığı sürece genel IP'leri reddeder. Stash'te bir kullanıcı adı ve parola belirle veya bu IP'ye public_whitelist ile izin ver."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash 在未设置凭证时会拒绝公网 IP。请在 Stash 中设置用户名和密码，或通过 public_whitelist 允许此 IP。"}}}},"hint_stash_rejected_reverse_proxy_in":{"localizations":{"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash önündeki ters proxy'yi reddetti. Proxy'nin IP'sini Stash yapılandırmasındaki trusted_proxies'e ekle."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash 拒絕了位於其前方的反向代理伺服器。請將代理伺服器的 IP 加入 Stash 設定中的 trusted_proxies。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash 拒绝了其前面的反向代理。请将代理的 IP 添加到 Stash 配置中的 trusted_proxies。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash avvisade den omvända proxyn framför den. Lägg till proxyns IP i trusted_proxies i Stashs konfiguration."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stashが前段のリバースプロキシを拒否しました。Stashの設定でプロキシのIPをtrusted_proxiesに追加してください。"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash rejected the reverse proxy in front of it. Add the proxy's IP to trusted_proxies in Stash's config."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash heeft de reverse proxy ervoor geweigerd. Voeg het IP-adres van de proxy toe aan trusted_proxies in de configuratie van Stash."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"O Stash rejeitou o proxy reverso à sua frente. Adicione o IP do proxy a trusted_proxies na configuração do Stash."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash afviste den reverse proxy, der står foran. Føj proxyens IP til trusted_proxies i Stashs konfiguration."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash a rejeté le proxy inverse placé devant lui. Ajoutez l'IP du proxy à trusted_proxies dans la configuration de Stash."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash ha rifiutato il reverse proxy davanti a sé. Aggiungi l'IP del proxy a trusted_proxies nella configurazione di Stash."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash отклонил обратный прокси перед ним. Добавьте IP прокси в trusted_proxies в конфигурации Stash."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash hat den vorgeschalteten Reverse-Proxy abgelehnt. Trage die IP des Proxys unter trusted_proxies in der Stash-Konfiguration ein."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash가 앞단의 리버스 프록시를 거부했습니다. Stash 구성의 trusted_proxies에 프록시 IP를 추가하세요."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash odrzucił reverse proxy działające przed nim. Dodaj IP proxy do trusted_proxies w konfiguracji Stash."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash avviste den omvendte proxyen foran den. Legg til proxyens IP i trusted_proxies i Stash-konfigurasjonen."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash rechazó el proxy inverso que tiene delante. Añade la IP del proxy a trusted_proxies en la configuración de Stash."}}}},"hint_stashy_arg_arg_is_ready":{"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy %@ (%@) is ready."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy %@ (%@) jest gotowe."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy %@ (%@) is klaar."}},"ja":{"st